      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Duck into chợ Hàn (Hàn market, the central market by the river) for a first taste of local life — dried squid, coffee beans, and the good kind of chaos."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p283",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "My Khe stretches long and easy — perfect for a barefoot wander and a first look at the East Sea."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p165",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Grab a stool and let the chả bò do the talking — smoky, savoury, and very Đà Nẵng. Ngon quá (so tasty)."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p258",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "The dragon breathes colour over the river once the sky goes dark — stand on the east bank and let it roar."
    }
  ]
}
```

